544
00:50:40,020 --> 00:50:41,300
Take that away.

545
00:50:41,300 --> 00:50:42,200
Yes, that's enough.

546
00:50:42,520 --> 00:50:44,280
I am a demigod.

547
00:50:46,020 --> 00:50:47,280
And I will beat you.

548
