You don't want anything
to happen to any of this.

549
00:50:50,800 --> 00:50:51,580
Yes, exactly you.

550
00:50:51,780 --> 00:50:52,700
Just the way you
don't want that.

551
00:50:52,800 --> 00:50:54,800
This thing doesn't create
life, it's a beacon of death.

552
00:50:54,800 --> 00:50:57,260
And if you don't get rid of
it, bad things will happen.

553
00:50:57,460 --> 00:50:58,340
